00:03:49.693 --> 00:03:52.607
"Hey, thanks for following me
and check out my new e-book."

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:53.710
Like, it's not real.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.067
Like, that, to me, is the muck

00:03:56.067 --> 00:03:58.528
and so, of course it's a reality.

00:03:58.528 --> 00:04:01.442
I don't hand deliver every e-mail.

00:04:01.442 --> 00:04:03.229
There's a lot of things
that are appropriate.

00:04:03.229 --> 00:04:05.779
I argue around automating the human thing.

00:04:05.779 --> 00:04:08.600
I argue around outsourcing
the human thing.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.132
I don't think a celebrity
should have their

00:04:10.132 --> 00:04:12.756
